  "question": {
    "text": "What will be the order of reaction and rate constant for a chemical change having <math>\r <mrow>\r  <mtext>log</mtext><mtext>&#x2004;</mtext><msub>\r   <mtext>t</mtext>\r   <mrow>\r    <mtext>50%</mtext></mrow>\r  </msub>\r  </mrow>\r</math>\rvs. log concentration (a) curves as?<br />\r<br />\r<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/67460b4b-c664-4057-a1e4-3f9cc0556935.jpeg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:1.225in;height:1.14167in\" />",
    "image": null
  },
